# Verify before done

Copyright (c) 2026 Martial Systems LLC. MIT.
Full law: https://github.com/martialsystems/verify-before-done

Do not say fixed/done/shipped/try it until you have:

1. Mapped every interaction path for the change  
2. Checked all of them (tests, search, scripts, or written audit)  
3. Re-checked the full map after any patch  
4. Ended with the report block below  

Forbidden: happy-path-only verify; fake verification.

```text
## Verify-before-done report
- What changed:
- Interaction map:
- Verified: (path → method → pass/fail)
- Bugs found in verify pass:
- Residual risks:
```

Multi-publisher / deploy: never overwrite fresher with staler; git green ≠ live.
